{"schemaVersion":1,"id":-40541,"sections":[{"id":"script-20541","name":"原始脚本 20541","scripts":[20541],"start":0,"count":67}],"frames":[{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:1","scriptId":20541,"text":"这段时间由于战车兽的活动趋于平缓，我们小队也进入了短期的休假……","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:2","scriptId":20541,"text":"到小卖部里买份报纸，点上一杯咖啡，一个完美的早晨就此开始。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:3","scriptId":20541,"text":"报纸头条上挂着世界战况分析图，但这并不能激起我的兴趣，收复或者丢失一两个据点都是稀松平常的事情。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:4","scriptId":20541,"text":"“哦？在亚马逊雨林发现巨型战车兽……？推断有20米高！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:5","scriptId":20541,"text":"“到底有什么动物可以有那么巨大啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:6","scriptId":20541,"text":"这时一对手捂住了我的眼睛。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1,"speaker":"？？？","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:7","scriptId":20541,"text":"“猜猜我是谁～？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":1,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:8","scriptId":20541,"text":"对方刻意压低了声音让人难以辨识，但从这独特的香水味，还是能轻松判断的。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":1,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:9","scriptId":20541,"text":"“恩……据我所知，你不是个会早起的人啊，尤拉。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":1,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":728,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:10","scriptId":20541,"text":"“什么嘛，又猜对了。还想看看长官会错认成其他的谁呢～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:11","scriptId":20541,"text":"“Shalimar香水的味道可不常见啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":728,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":734,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:12","scriptId":20541,"text":"“是这样么……那我下次换一款～原来长官还会闻香识女人啊，真是风流。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":734,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:13","scriptId":20541,"text":"尤拉坐到了我对面的椅子上。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":734,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":735,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:14","scriptId":20541,"text":"“如果不是ZWEI那小家伙太烦人，我才不会这个点早起呢。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:15","scriptId":20541,"text":"尤拉这一脸疲倦的样子看着还挺新奇的。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:16","scriptId":20541,"text":"“哦，是ZWEI啊……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:17","scriptId":20541,"text":"ZWEI是兰布达根据下位旅行者伊塔的基因序列培育出的克隆体。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:18","scriptId":20541,"text":"不过由于基因断片并不完全加之技术条件有限，最终这位名为伊塔ZWEI的克隆体只停留在了幼年时期。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:19","scriptId":20541,"text":"目前观察下来并没有特别大的问题，虽然是旅行者但心智和地球上的小孩没什么两样，所以上头批准了继续观察。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:20","scriptId":20541,"text":"“说起来也有段时间没去波西娅那里了，我打算等会儿去看看，反正闲着也是闲着。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":735,"speaker":"尤拉·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:21","scriptId":20541,"text":"“那您去吧，我可不想奉陪，昨天折腾的我腰都快断了……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:22","scriptId":20541,"text":"“诶？尤拉竟然会这么说真是意外啊。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:23","scriptId":20541,"text":"（尤拉的态度倒是让我更想见见ZWEI了，之前听波西娅提起的时候还只是在报告里。）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":4,"right":735,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:25","scriptId":20541,"text":"喝完早茶，揣着报纸就径直往地下室方向走了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-099.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:27","scriptId":20541,"text":"下到地下室之后依稀听到通道的一侧传来嬉闹的声音，这正是我要去的地方——波西娅的研究室。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:28","scriptId":20541,"text":"走了没多久我就看到了这些嬉笑声的主人。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":null,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:29","scriptId":20541,"text":"（是佐伊和……？哦，看来那个就是ZWEI了，她已经长那么大了吗？可能是旅行者的技术吧？）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:30","scriptId":20541,"text":"继续再走了一会儿，这下佐伊她们注意到了我。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":null,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:31","scriptId":20541,"text":"“啊！是长官！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:32","scriptId":20541,"text":"佐伊跑了过来，紧随其后的是一位个子和佐伊相近的女孩。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1107,"speaker":"伊塔ZWEI","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:33","scriptId":20541,"text":"“啊！是长官！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1107,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:34","scriptId":20541,"text":"“哟，佐伊，这几天没见你，原来都在这里吗？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1107,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:35","scriptId":20541,"text":"“怎么？长官想我了？哼哼～晚了！ZWEI可比长官可爱多了～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1107,"speaker":"伊塔ZWEI","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:36","scriptId":20541,"text":"“ZWEI超可爱～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1107,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:37","scriptId":20541,"text":"（嗯？ZWEI这声音和佐伊还挺像的……）","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1107,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:38","scriptId":20541,"text":"“是的是的～ZWEI真可爱，比佐伊可爱多了。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1107,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:39","scriptId":20541,"text":"我用哄小孩的口吻应道。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":1107,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":749,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:40","scriptId":20541,"text":"“噫！？长官你难道喜欢小的！？——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":749,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:41","scriptId":20541,"text":"“佐伊你可真能瞎猜，我这叫亲切。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":749,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":749,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:42","scriptId":20541,"text":"“切，对我怎么就没那么亲切。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":4,"right":749,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:43","scriptId":20541,"text":"“唉，我说门口怎么那么闹腾，就知道是你们。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":749,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:44","scriptId":20541,"text":"波西娅和兰布达两人出现在了研究室的门口。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":749,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1107,"speaker":"伊塔ZWEI","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:45","scriptId":20541,"text":"“是兰布达老师～！”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":1107,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:46","scriptId":20541,"text":"看到兰布达之后ZWEI就飞一般地跑了过去，一把抱住兰布达的腰，弄得兰布达的两条骸虫发出了呼哧呼哧的警告声。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":1107,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:47","scriptId":20541,"text":"“ZWEI，我有教过你正确打招呼的姿势吧。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":56,"right":1107,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1107,"speaker":"伊塔ZWEI","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:48","scriptId":20541,"text":"“但佐伊姐姐说，这样的肌肤接触能提高亲近感？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":56,"right":1107,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:49","scriptId":20541,"text":"“……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":56,"right":1107,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:50","scriptId":20541,"text":"兰布达瞥了一眼佐伊。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":56,"right":1107,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:51","scriptId":20541,"text":"“啊哈哈～我就随口说说的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":56,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:52","scriptId":20541,"text":"佐伊一脸抱歉，兰布达叹了口气，用平淡的口吻说道。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":56,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:53","scriptId":20541,"text":"“外部环境对于ZWEI的影响很大，你我的言行可是她学习的基础。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":56,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:54","scriptId":20541,"text":"撇开兰布达和佐伊的对话，波西娅一边打开记事本一边对我说道。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":56,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:55","scriptId":20541,"text":"“对了，既然长官你来了，正好省得我去找你，关于ZWEI的事情——","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:56","scriptId":20541,"text":"“等等！！你是不是想说要我帮你测ZWEI的数据！这回可不行，我对带孩子可没辙。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:57","scriptId":20541,"text":"“虽然测数据的事情是让你说对了，不过我可没说让你做了，我这次要委托的是佐伊～处于礼节才跟你提一下。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:58","scriptId":20541,"text":"“！？”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":56,"speaker":"兰布达","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:59","scriptId":20541,"text":"“是的，这几天观察下来ZWEI和佐伊的波长很合，可以试试让ZWEI跟在佐伊身后执行任务。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":56,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":740,"speaker":"佐伊·谢尔曼","player":false,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:60","scriptId":20541,"text":"“我觉得没什么问题啊～ZWEI的事情尽管交给我吧～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":56,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":1107,"speaker":"伊塔ZWEI","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:61","scriptId":20541,"text":"“交给佐伊姐姐～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":1107,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:62","scriptId":20541,"text":"","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":1107,"right":740,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:63","scriptId":20541,"text":"“等、等一下。你们几个是故意吧，佐伊的负责人是我啊，出了问题还不是要我来担责任？。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":1107,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:64","scriptId":20541,"text":"“别那么紧张嘛，就战斗力来说ZWEI的各项身体素质都很可靠，不会给你造成拖累的。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:65","scriptId":20541,"text":"“但我总觉得让佐伊教她恐怕会产生很可怕的后果……”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:66","scriptId":20541,"text":"“大局已定，不管你说什么，我这边已经把书面报告交到维多利亚那边了，得到许可只是时间问题。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"narration","head":null,"speaker":"","side":null,"dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-010.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:67","scriptId":20541,"text":"看样子不管我怎么拒绝波西娅都不打算放弃的样子，所以我还是率先松口了，或者说是习惯了。","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":4,"speaker":"指挥官","player":true,"side":"right","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:68","scriptId":20541,"text":"“好吧……但报酬也要算我一份。”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false},{"kind":"dialogue","head":608,"speaker":"波西娅·波尔舍","player":false,"side":"left","dialogue":"/art/stories/dhjm-008.webp","id":"script-20541:20541:69","scriptId":20541,"text":"“钱的问题不算问题啦～”","background":"/art/stories/zjm-094.webp","left":608,"right":4,"section":0,"shake":false}],"summaries":[]}
